+# Authorized0.36 candidate — preserve the upstream design system
+
+This is a compatibility port, not a visual redesign. Use upstream Geist,
+existing semantic CSS/theme variables in src/app/globals.css, and the existing
+Label/Select/Input/dialog components, sizes, focus states and motion tokens.
+The only new create-form row is the translated browser-engine Select. CBrowser
+is available only after native capability discovery; unavailable runtime disables
+that option. Keep new upstream forms, templates and accessibility behavior.
+
+No new palette, raw colors, font sizes or animation conventions were introduced.
+Native UI screenshot/accessibility checks and independent visual review remain
+pending; TypeScript compilation alone is not visual verification.
